---@field NumberOfAssignmentsAvailable? aws.mturk.Integer The number of assignments for this HIT that are available for Workers to accept.
---@field NumberOfAssignmentsCompleted? aws.mturk.Integer The number of assignments for this HIT that have been approved or rejected.

